        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn IW3BI / IW3BD, 16\" Swirl Lever Mortise Cylinder Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis arched mortise cylinder lockset made by Acorn features a C-style grip on the exterior and a swirl lever on the interior. It is available in either single cylinder or dummy functions for doors 1-3/4\" to 3\" thick with 2-3/4\" backsets. The black iron finish of the 16\" Swirl Lever Mortise Cylinder Handleset grants it an antique feel that complements its traditional styling.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/forged-iron-swirl-lever-set-with-round-rose-acorn-iwebi\"><b>Forged Iron Swirl Lever Set With Round Rose</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"2\" border=0\" class=\"text\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the 16\" Swirl Lever Mortise Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For exterior and interior use.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy gauge plated steel mortise case.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-friction brass latch bolt.</li>\r\n<li>The deadbolt is made of brass with hardened steel inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Acorn Iron Art Mortise Cylinder Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Height: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" Standard, Optional up to 3\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Stile Width: Recommend 4-1/2” with a 4-1/4” minimum.</li>\r\n<li>Emergency Egress - Panic Proof</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ACO-Mortise-Specifications.gif?v=1704354518\" width=\"255\" height=\"273\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Acorn Mortise Lock Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Handleset:</b> Blank trim for non-working doors that does not have a turnpiece or a cylinder. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> A key operates the deadbolt from the exterior while a thumbturn operates it from the interior. The latch is operated by a lever from both the exterior and the interior. Panic Proof: Turning of inside lever will retract both dead-bolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe handing actually refers to the mortise lock, rather than the lever. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Due to the handmade craftsman nature of this product, all dimensions are approximate. DO NOT DRILL ANY HOLES until you have the actual pieces to be mounted.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
